	(text "MSM261DHP006 (MEMSensing DS-042 Ver.1.1): VDD 1.6-3.6 V, IDD 670 uA at 2.4 MHz, VIH 0.7 VDD, VIL 0.3 VDD,\n  clock 1.1-4.8 MHz, edge <= 20 ns; L/R = GND -> DATA valid on CLK falling edge.\nCable (JST SR 1.0, A05SR05SR30K305B, cut >= 175 mm): 1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 CLK, 4 SEL, 5 DATA - SEL is static,\n  so it separates CLK from DATA like a ground. Default: U1 fitted, R3 open, R4 33 Ohm, R5 0 Ohm, JP1 open.\nLevers (bench 2.5): R3 bypass with U1 removed; R4 100 Ohm; R5 out + JP1 if the cable SEL is not wanted.\nPassives 0603 (D42); ESD in SOD-523 (D42: leaded alternative to the X1SON); MK1 LGA accepted as is."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
